/-
# Axiom audit (not part of the library target)

Prints the axioms used by every declaration that `results.json` references (main results, auxiliary lemmas and
definitions cited by name, non-vacuity witnesses, counterexamples, positive controls) and by every other
declaration quoted in `REPORT.md`. Every declaration must report a subset of `propext`,
`Classical.choice`, `Quot.sound`.

Run from this directory after `lake build`:

    lake env lean AxiomAudit.lean
-/
